  "abstract": "Control baseline for reviewer suggestion: reduce MLP depth (single hidden layer H=384) with RC head. Tests whether a weaker MLP benefits from horizon weighting later. Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, dr=0.10, curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, 60\u2011min trials.",
